From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:41:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] Add Publishers.Merge through Merge8 and MergeMany

Apple's interface declares Publishers.Merge, Merge3 through Merge8,
MergeMany and the merge(with:) operators on Publisher and on each merge
type; OpenCombine has none of them. The behaviour they share, and the
one Publishers.CombineLatest builds on, is in Helpers/MergeKit.swift;
Publishers.Merge.swift holds one struct per arity with its operator
chain and its equality.
